{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"完美域"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"完美域"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $k$ 为域. 若如下等价条件之一成立, 则称 $k$ 为<strong>完美域</strong> (perfect field):</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$k$ 的任何代数扩张都"},{"Local":{"url":"可分扩张","text":"可分"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li>$k$ 是 $0$ 特征域, 或者 $k$ 是 $p$ 特征域 ($p$ 为素数) 且 $k$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Frobenius态射","text":"Frobenius 映射"}},{"Plain":"为同构.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}